WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.910
Human language.

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:09.580
There is a human in this world.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.490
What would you like to do?

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.290
Eliminate them.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.450
No one must know
there is a human here.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.120
Humans are considered to be bad.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.240
Sara!

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.540
Did the recon squad find out
about this place?

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.370
What are you going to do?

00:00:32.990 --> 00:00:33.870
Stop Zero!

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.700
Zero, are you fully recharged?

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:42.490
Humans will destroy the world.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.290
They are evil.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.160
Humans are not harmful!

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.950
Sara is a very good human.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:54.910
Stop!

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:59.410
Why do you hate humans
so much?

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.540
To create a perfect world,

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.910
humans are a hindrance.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:08.330
It can't be…

